From e1e3cdb2312577f136d6867edf22fc228f800cf9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: djnice <djnice@freemail.hu>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 10:00:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Thumbnails: Dolby Vision profile 5 and bookmarks on Amlogic

Chapter / video thumbnails of a Dolby Vision profile 5 file were green and
purple: its base layer is IPT-PQ-c2, not BT.2020 YCbCr. The software decoder
now hands the frame's AVDOVIMetadata to the picture, and PictureToTexture
rebuilds profile 5 (BL compatibility id 0) like libplacebo: reshaping
(polynomial / MMR), the RPU's ycc_to_rgb matrix, PQ EOTF, rgb_to_lms and the
ICtCp LMS -> BT.2020 matrix into PQ RGB48 tagged with the L1 max, then the
usual sws_scale_frame perceptual tonemap.

User bookmarks got only a placeholder where the renderer cannot capture the
video (Amlogic: own plane, no readback): the capture callback now falls back
to decoding the bookmarked picture from the file (ExtractThumbToTexture with
a time, decoding on from the keyframe to that time).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
